{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/alohahawaiitours/items/141477/", "pk": 141477, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/alohahawaiitours/", "pk": 466, "shortname": "alohahawaiitours", "name": "Aloha Hawaii Tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Sights & Bites Circle Island Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 4, "unicode": "Sights & Bites Circle Island Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": -2000, "description": "##Rate\n\n-  Adult (13+): $149\n- Child (4-11)  $99\n- Lapchild (0-3) Free!\n\n________\n\n##Duration\n\n- 8 Hours\n\n__________________\n\n##Highlights Include:\n- Amelia Earhart/Diamond Head Lookout\n- Poi Donuts from Kamehameha Bakery\n- Halona \"Blowhole\" Lookout\n- Nuuanu Pali Lookout\n- Macadamia Nut Farm\n- Lunch at the Shrimp Truck\n- North Shore Fruit Stand\n- Puaʻena Point Turtle Spotting\n- Dole Pineapple Plantation\n\n---\n\n##Description\n\n- Begin your adventure by boarding your air-conditioned vehicle and enjoy a narrated scenic drive along the south and east shore coastline of Oahu.\n\n- Our first stop is at the Diamond Head/Amelia Earhart Lookout, where our guests will enjoy a fresh Poi donut from famous Kamehameha Bakery and panoramic views of the popular local surf beach.\n\n- From here, guests will enjoy a scenic ride to the famous Halona Point blowhole where, when tide conditions are right, waves surging through a submerged lava tube erupt in a spectacular geyser of seawater! Keep a keen eye out from December through May for a glimpse of giant humpback whales that frequent the waters here and green sea turtles year-round.\n\n- Travel to higher altitudes to take in breathtaking views of the island's lush windward side from the Pali Lookout in the rugged Koʻolau Mountains. This stunning lookout was the site of a bloody battle in 1795 in which King Kamehameha I forced hundreds of his opponents to jump to their deaths from the cliffs there in what was called the \"Battle of the Leaping Fish.\" \n\n- From the Pali, we head to the Tropical Macadamia Nut Farm where guests will have the opportunity to sample local coffee, chocolate & macadamia nuts.\n\n- As we make our way to the North Shores of Oahu, we stop for lunch at the Shrimp Truck and a locally-owned Fruit stand for guests to get another taste of the island’s cuisine.\n\n- Continuing along the North Shore of the Island, we head to Puaʻena Point, a spot known to be loved by Green Sea Turtles!\n\n- Last but definitely not least we travel to the Famous Dole Pineapple Plantation where guests will have the chance to try the delicious Dole Whip, a dairy-free pineapple dessert.\n\nTour is wheelchair accessible with at least 48-hour notice to reserve our ADA accessible tour bus.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "PLEASE NOTE THAT YOU MUST BE PICKED UP FROM A WAIKIKI HOTEL IN ORDER TO PARTICIPATE IN THIS TOUR\n\nIf you were given a paper voucher, please bring it with you. \n\nPlease allow a 10 min grace period on pick up times due to variable traffic in Waikiki. Mahalo!\n\nNo refund issued for cancellation unless made outside of 24 Hours from the Activity Start Time.\n\nGeneral Excise Tax of 4.7% and a 3% service fee is added to all retail rates. \n\nPlease remember to bring all the personal items you will need to make your tour as pleasurable as possible. \n\nThe reservations department may contact you to confirm your pickup information the night before your tour. If you do not receive a courtesy call, please call 808.926.3800.", "cancellation_notes": "No refund issued for cancellation unless made outside of 24 Hours from the Activity Start Time.", "no_transportation_notes": "PLEASE NOTE THAT YOU MUST BE PICKED UP FROM A WAIKIKI HOTEL IN ORDER TO PARTICIPATE IN THIS TOUR", "no_transportation_minutes": 10, "headline": "Sights & Bites Tour", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/alohahawaiitours/items/141477/images/1104669/", "pk": 1104669, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/RDZLOzvKRVeXaOHkO86R", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/RDZLOzvKRVeXaOHkO86R", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/alohahawaiitours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/alohahawaiitours/items/141477/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/RDZLOzvKRVeXaOHkO86R", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/RDZLOzvKRVeXaOHkO86R", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/alohahawaiitours/items/141477/images/350006/", "pk": 350006, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/MjTOHvSE62q1lZf4Nvjg", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/MjTOHvSE62q1lZf4Nvjg", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/alohahawaiitours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/alohahawaiitours/items/141477/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackc